sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant FE as Frontend (React)
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant S as Scribe Engine
    participant RAG as Context Service (RSS News)
    participant O as Ollama (finwise_scribe_v1)

    U->>FE: Ask "Why is MSFT volatile?"
    FE->>API: POST /ai/chat {msg, symbol="MSFT"}
    API->>S: POST /chat {msg, symbol="MSFT"}
    
    S->>S: Fetch Symbolized Market Tokens (30d)
    S->>RAG: Fetch Breaking News
    RAG-->>S: "Microsoft announces new AI chips..."
    
    note right of S: Compile Context: Tokens + News + User Query
    
    S->>O: POST /api/generate (Model: finwise_scribe_v1)
    note over O: Inference using Fine-Tuned SLM
    O-->>S: "The P_9_V_9 momentum aligns with recent AI chip news..."
    
    S-->>API: { response: "The P_9_V_9 momentum..." }
    API-->>FE: { response: "The P_9_V_9 momentum..." }
    FE->>U: Display AI Assistant Message